# refpass_r233 — referee pass, `note1.tex` §`sec:twothm`

**Round**: r233. **Date**: 2026-08-18. **Procedure**: `tools/referee_pass.md`.
**Context**: fresh — a reader that had not written the section, had not seen the rounds
behind it (r220–r232), and was given the three jobs and nothing else. It read `note1.tex`
to fix notation and reported only on the nine units of the new section.
**Batch**: 9 units, cap 15. **Gate**: this pass gates the milestone (v1.3.0), not the push.

